  "text": "QA Owner full 1792004605417\nRESTAURANT ADMIN\nQA Owner full 1792004605417 — Main Branch\nCtrl+K\nNo open shift\nEOD Report\nReconciliation\nAssistant\nLogout\nBranch\nChoose branch\nAll restaurant · overview\nQA Owner full 1792004605417 — Main Branch · MAIN\nOrders, tables, inventory and devices belong to this branch.\nRestaurant workspace\n← Back to managementShow advanced tools\nLAUNCH SETUP\nGuided Menu Setup\nPayment Acceptance\nTables & QR\nPayment Settings\nOrdering Rules\nINSIGHTS\nCollection Reconciliation\nAnalytics\nLIVE OPERATIONS\nPickup Calendar\nOverview\nQR Orders\nService Requests\nBRANDING\nQR Print Packs\nCustomer Branding\nMENU & GUESTS\nCustomers & Loyalty\nMenu & Availability\nADVANCED CONFIGURATION\nAdvanced Features\nFeature controls\nTranslations\nPromotions\nFeedback\nAlerts\nCollections\nLicense\nQR Ordering license active\nQA Owner full plan 1792004605417 · 16/10/2026\nLicenses and device access are managed by your platform administrator.\nProduct website\nQR ORDERING / ADVANCED CONFIGURATION\nAdvanced Features\n\nConfigure licensed languages, loyalty, promotions and operational tools.\n\n✦ JAMAN AI\nEnabled\nAdvanced QR capabilities\n\nQA Owner full plan 1792004605417 · 0 active codes · 1 active branches\n\nOptional access comes from Super Admin plans and add-ons. Existing ordering continues to work independently.\n\nFeatures for this branch\n\nOnly changed settings become local overrides. Settings follow restaurant defaults.\n\nCounted dish stock reservations\nIncluded in your license\nVerified customer loyalty\nIncluded in your license\nShared table sessions\nIncluded in your license\nMultilingual menu\nIncluded in your license\nPrivate order feedback\nIncluded in your license\nBrowser order history\nIncluded in your license\nOperational alerts\nIncluded in your license\nShared kitchen workload\nIncluded in your license\nMenu recommendations\nIncluded in your license\nAdvanced workload estimates\n\nCounts unfinished dish quantities across POS, Captain, Kiosk and QR in this branch. No accepted order is automatically cancelled.\n\nStop new QR orders at units (0 = unlimited)\nBusy estimate threshold (0 = off)\nExtra minutes when busy\nRecommended menu items (customers choose whether to add)\nAlert types\n NEW ORDER\n CASH DUE\n PAYMENT COLLECTED\n PAYMENT PENDING\n CANCELLED\n REFUND\nSave changes\nCounted portions for this branch\n\nOptional exact counts for ready-to-sell dishes. Ingredient recipes continue through the existing inventory ledger. Enable counted stock reservations above to protect simultaneous QR checkouts.\n\nBranch\nChoose branch...\nQA Owner full 1792004605417 — Main Branch\nDish\nChoose dish...\nCurrent portions (blank = inherit/manual)\nSave counted portions\nBranch preferences and inheritance\n\nUse the branch selector in the app header. All-branch propagation requires the owner account. Existing local overrides are always preserved.",
